No.

266
00:18:03,313 --> 00:18:05,020
This is the climax, Vash the star.

267
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,640
So do you hate me?

268
00:18:20,080 --> 00:18:21,140
I'm not surprised.

269
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:23,157
If you do, I wouldn't blame you.

270
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,181
So many sad things happen to you.

271
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:28,877
Whether they are friend or
enemy, the people you meet die.

272
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:32,120
It's enough to sap one's tears.

273
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,380
Shut up!

274
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:36,320
You know this is not finished yet.

275
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:39,760
Did you really expect the
end to come so easily?

276
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:43,935
Don't you understand you're not human?

277
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:46,820
It is time to realize exactly who you are.

278
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,920
It can't be!

279
00:18:52,780 --> 00:18:54,620
There is power in that light.

280
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:56,996
Power that you have always possessed.

281
00:18:57,380 --> 00:18:59,780
Even more, this represents what you are.

282
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:10,830
I...

283
00:19:10,913 --> 00:19:12,100
I can't...

284
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:14,737
Not again...

285
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:16,500
NOT AGAIN!

286
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:24,500
Haven't you given up yet, Vash?

287
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,748
It's really quite annoying.

288
00:19:34,180 --> 00:19:35,010
Bastard!

289
00:19:35,093 --> 00:19:36,017
You're out of options.

290
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:37,571
Fight back or you'll die.

291
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,153
Why don't you go ahead?

292
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:46,419
I would welcome this to be my time.

293
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,350
After all,

294
00:19:47,433 --> 00:19:49,397
there's no reason for such
an egocentric and complete

295
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:52,304
life like mine to be
allowed to continue anyway.

296
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:54,300
Give me the gift of nothingness.

297
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:55,680
Give me death.

298
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:58,460
My master is waiting for you.

299
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,699
He's looking forward to your visit.

300
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:04,160
I was compelled to attach
this arm to myself.

301
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:07,185
I had to because you
refused to be by his side.

302
00:20:09,860 --> 00:20:10,820
Kill me.

303
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:12,700
I can't.

304
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:14,120
Go ahead.

305
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,940
I can't!

306
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:21,430
Millie!

307
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:26,740
Stop them!

308
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:27,960
No more!

309
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:33,900
I said stop it now!

310
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,720
And shoot me!

311
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,120
It's alright. Kill me.

312
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:45,880
It's simple.

313
00:20:46,100 --> 00:20:47,937
All you need do is pull the trigger.

314
00:20:48,020 --> 00:20:50,785
Once you have killed me,
this will all be over.

315
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,000
Come on.

316
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:53,217
Time to choose.

317
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:56,980
You have free will stop
it don't make me shoot.

318
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:06,117
Your faith is hopelessly obstinate
to actually believe the prattlings

319
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,937
of a woman who speaks in idealistic
terms that are worthless.

320
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:11,717
I guess that kind of
thinking is reasonable

321
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,637
for someone who's lived
for more than a century.

322
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:18,080
But that that way of life
is pathetic and comical.

323
00:21:19,620 --> 00:21:25,360
Rem savor A wasted existence who
only spoke in aggravating logic.

324
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:27,600
A worthless human being.

325
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:30,540
Just like me, but unlike you.

326
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:32,080
That's enough!

327
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:37,040
Luck and persistence won't work forever.

328
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:41,660
As we journey through our lives,

329
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:45,120
we must always search for
ways to make everyone happy.

330
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,272
Don't force your way of life upon others.

331
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:53,842
No one has the right to
take the life of another.

332
00:21:55,100 --> 00:21:57,865
Don't tell me your dreams
in a world like this!

333
00:21:58,600 --> 00:22:02,306
If you keep your vision clear,
you will always find the future.

334
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,717
I understand.

335
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:28,340
Master, bash the Stampede, you will
experience eternal pain and suffering.

336
00:22:55,140 --> 00:22:57,960
I don't know.

337
00:22:58,340 --> 00:23:00,537
Thank

338
00:23:00,620 --> 00:23:07,620
you.

339
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:46,437
I'll see you

340
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:50,420
next time.

341
00:23:58,340 --> 00:23:59,170
NO!

342
00:24:06,980 --> 00:24:08,340
I was dreaming, Rem.

343
00:24:09,700 --> 00:24:11,524
Everything was so horribly dry.

344
00:24:12,140 --> 00:24:13,375
There on that planet.

345
00:24:13,940 --> 00:24:15,175
Even people's hearts.

346
00:24:16,420 --> 00:24:19,457
As I watched the people who
lived there from far away,

347
00:24:19,540 --> 00:24:21,952
I kept wondering why they went on living.

348
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,812
How they kept on living.

349
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,510
Rem.

350
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,979
Listen to me, Rem.

351
00:24:30,980 --> 00:24:32,057
I did a bad thing.

352
00:24:32,140 --> 00:24:33,237
I did a bad thing.

353
00:24:33,320 --> 00:24:34,849
Tell me, what should I do?
